<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds pulled higher by Italian BTPs.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds pulled higher by Italian BTPs.</headline>
<text>
<p>0720 GMT - Bonos open higher on Monday, tracking Italian market after Friday's BOI's rate cut. But Spanish Treasury refunding auctions from tomorrow seen limiting further gains</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.35 vs 107.15, yield 6.31 vs 6.34</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.98 vs 116.78 at Friday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.48/51 vs 84.51/53</p>
